# Default lychee ignore list for STScI notebook repositories.
#
# Each non-comment line is a regular expression matched against URLs. Matching
# links are skipped by the weekly broken-link check (the unified workflow's
# enable-link-check). Add repository-specific exclusions below.

# Auth-gated endpoint (migrated from the old broken_link_checker.yml)
acspsf\.stsci\.edu

# "Open an issue" links on the published pages of any spacetelescope notebook
# repo (jdat_notebooks, hst_notebooks, mast_notebooks, hellouniverse,
# jwst-pipeline-notebooks, roman_notebooks, and the repo itself).
github\.com/spacetelescope/[^/]+/issues/new
